meta {
  name: Spaces - Create - Link
  type: http
  seq: 99
}

post {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/communities/nswswk8w8wso0ko8owwk8k0w/spaces
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "space_group_cuid": "q8kspacegroupstarthere01",
    "name": "Book a call",
    "emoji": "📅",
    "type": "link",
    "visibility": "members",
    "url": "https://example.com/book-a-call"
  }
}

docs {
  A link space (#1294, ADR 0026): a navigation item that opens a page outside Knowii in a new tab. It holds no content, so it needs no posting_policy. The url is required for a link space and refused for the other types (400). Same visibility and access groups as any space. Returns 201 with the space and its url. Needs spaces:write.
}
